h1: About this starter

p: This starter is intentionally lightweight.

h2: Folder map

li: [code:src/pages] contains [code:.bs] and [code:.html] page files
li: [code:src/public] copies directly into the final site
li: [code:src/styles.css] styles every page

h2: Next ideas

